@startuml
title Delivery Changes — AS-IS

start

:Delivery-affecting data changed;

:Request delivery
availability recalculation;

:Recalculate delivery
availability;

if (Previous delivery selection
remains valid?) then (Yes)

    :Preserve current
    delivery selection;

else (No)

    :Invalidate previous
    delivery selection;

    :Require delivery method
    selection or confirmation;

endif

stop

@enduml
